      "content": "LONDON ROAD 1. 5252                                                   (South Side)                                                   Moor End Cottage                                                   [Formerly listed as                                                   Moor End Cottages -                                                   Nos 1, 2 and 3                                                   No 4 (Daymar)] TL 00 NW 10/192           23.8.74. II 2. C17, half refaced C18.  Until recently 4 cottages.  Timber frame, colour washed brick and brick nogging.  Ground floor partly underbuilt in colour washed brick. Old tiled roof.  Former Nos 1 and 2 have 2 triple light casement windows.  Former Nos 3 and 4 have C19 windows, 1 casement and 2 sashes. Listing NGR: TL0359705915"
    }
